cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, its code or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Learning to Interact with Web Forms"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of 50 web forms with 10 answer sets each, scripted Playwright reference
  ("ideal") interaction runs, and tooling to evaluate LLM, VLM and computer-use agents
  (direct Playwright MCP tool use, native computer use, FormFactory-style visual interaction)
  on Google Forms and a self-hosted LocalForms copy.
type: software
